{"ticker":{"symbol":"025620.KS","name":"차AI헬스케어","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":4925.0,"change_pct":0.00101626016260159,"market_cap":89602908160.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":3795.0,"week52_high":14980.0,"sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Household & Personal Products","country":"South Korea","city":"Seoul","employees":41,"website":"https://www.jayjun.co.kr","business_summary":"Cha AI Healthcare Co., Ltd., together with its subsidiaries, manufactures and distributes cosmetic products in South Korea. The company offers facial care products, including masks/packs, skin/toner/mist, pads/patches, ampoules/serums/essence, lotion/emulsion, creams/gels, cleansing/peeling, sun care, and beauty accessories products; skin cells/texture, moisture/moisturizing, whitening/brightening, and sensitive/calm care products; nutritional/elasticity/anti-aging care products; and UV protection care products. The company was formerly known as Jayjun Cosmetic Co., Ltd. and changed its name to Cha AI Healthcare Co., Ltd. in December 2025. Cha AI Healthcare Co., Ltd. was founded in 1972 and is headquartered in Seoul, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"Cha AI Healthcare Co., Ltd.는 자회사와 함께 한국에서 화장품을 제조 및 유통합니다. 이 회사는 마스크/팩, 스킨/토너/미스트, 패드/패치, 앰플/세럼/에센스, 로션/에멀젼, 크림/젤, 클렌징/필링, 선케어, 뷰티 액세서리 제품을 포함한 페이셜 케어 제품을 제공합니다. 피부 세포/결, 수분/보습, 미백/브라이트닝, 민감/진정 케어 제품; 영양/탄력/안티에이징 케어 제품; 자외선 차단 케어 제품도 있어요. 이 회사는 이전에 제이준화장품(주)로 알려졌으며 2025년 12월에 차아이헬스케어(주)로 상호를 변경했습니다. 차아이헬스케어(주)는 1972년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 서울에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"생활용품","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":6246244500.0,"operating_income":-7980182930.0,"net_income":-21434636960.0,"eps":-7588.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":16089005890.0,"operating_income":-9072276410.0,"net_income":-6796817370.0,"eps":-156